# Route: guide 48 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 19 quests, 0.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale, Thousand Needles, Un'Goro Crater): Booty Bay ->
# The Shimmering Flats -> Gurubashi Arena -> Nesingwary's Expedition ->
# Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound -> Wild Shore -> Jaguero Isle -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore
# -> The Shimmering Flats -> Lakkari Tar Pits.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Message in a Bottle (630; King
# Mukla 51); It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962; Blazerunner 56).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770).

